              },
              {
                "id": "q-cors-0002",
                "kind": "flattened_list",
                "target": "CORSConfiguration.CORSRules",
                "summary": "The rules repeat as sibling CORSRule elements directly under the CORSConfiguration root; a CORSRules wrapper element would make every SDK read zero rules.",
